@startuml keycloak-architecture
!theme plain
title Keycloak Architecture

package "Keycloak Server" {
  component [Realm\n---\npractice] as realm
  component [Client\n---\nbackend-client] as client
  component [Identity Provider] as idp
  component [User Store] as users
}

cloud "External IdP" {
  component [Google] as google
  component [GitHub] as github
}

database "PostgreSQL" as db

realm --> client : manages
realm --> idp : configures
realm --> users : stores
idp --> google : broker
idp --> github : broker
realm --> db : persists

note right of realm
  인증 도메인 단위
  사용자/클라이언트/역할 관리
end note

note right of client
  OAuth2/OIDC 클라이언트
  Client ID: backend-client
  Protocol: openid-connect
end note

note right of idp
  Social Login 연동
  Identity Brokering
end note

note bottom of db
  Port: 5432
  Keycloak 메타데이터 저장
end note

@enduml
